OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACambridge launches review into
OL,4,Asupport for Jason Arday before death
OL,5,
OL,6,FArday, 41, was found dead at his home
OL,7,Fin London on 14 August, the week after
OL,8,Fresigning from his position as
OL,9,Fprofessor of sociology of education
OL,10,Famid intense scrutiny over allegations
OL,11,Fof plagiarism. He had denied the
OL,12,Fclaims.
OL,14,FAnnouncing the review on Friday,
OL,15,FVice-Chancellor Prof Deborah Prentice
OL,16,Fsaid the time since his death had been
OL,17,Fa "period of profound sadness and
OL,18,Freflection for the university".
